            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.1.4</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Restore deleted recordings and completed imports with Undo or from Pending deletions for up to 24 hours, or delete them permanently sooner.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Live transcripts keep scrolling to new text after 100 segments.</li>
  <li>The recording waveform respects Reduce Motion while continuing to show audio levels.</li>
  <li>The Delete button is back in the session detail toolbar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
